1
00:01:05,300 --> 00:01:08,940
=When the Lights Rise=
=Episode 24=

2
00:01:19,020 --> 00:01:19,820
Get out.

3
00:01:20,700 --> 00:01:21,980
I said get out!

4
00:01:36,380 --> 00:01:37,580
What are you trying to do?

5
00:01:38,380 --> 00:01:40,060
Aren't you taking me
to the detention center?

6
00:01:40,140 --> 00:01:40,940
Kneel down.

7
00:01:43,900 --> 00:01:45,100
Someone wants you dead.

8
00:01:45,220 --> 00:01:46,660
We're just following orders.

9
00:01:48,180 --> 00:01:49,300
Who wants me dead?

10
00:01:49,820 --> 00:01:50,460
Boss Ren?

11
00:01:50,460 --> 00:01:51,340
Or Long Feng?

12
00:01:51,420 --> 00:01:52,460
You're about to die anyway.

13
00:01:52,460 --> 00:01:52,980
What's the point

14
00:01:52,980 --> 00:01:54,180
of asking so many questions?

15
00:02:21,060 --> 00:02:21,860
It's him?

16
00:02:22,900 --> 00:02:23,860
You know him too?

17
00:02:23,860 --> 00:02:25,300
He's working with Long Feng.

18
00:02:25,500 --> 00:02:26,980
They were both at Kaimeili just now.

19
00:02:27,420 --> 00:02:28,820
He has a grudge against me

20
00:02:28,820 --> 00:02:29,780
and Ding Zhao.

21
00:02:30,220 --> 00:02:31,740
I'm afraid he won't simply

22
00:02:31,740 --> 00:02:33,380
listen to Long Feng and release him.

23
00:02:33,620 --> 00:02:34,500
What should we do?

24
00:02:34,620 --> 00:02:35,740
Wait for me in the car.

25
00:02:35,820 --> 00:02:36,700
I'll go talk to him.

26
00:02:36,700 --> 00:02:37,460
Madam.

27
00:02:39,620 --> 00:02:40,420
Don't worry.

28
00:02:40,700 --> 00:02:41,860
He's still a member of Kun Society.

29
00:02:41,860 --> 00:02:43,260
He'll show me some respect.

30
00:02:52,620 --> 00:02:53,500
Detective Inspector Jiang.

31
00:02:55,620 --> 00:02:56,820
Looking quite impressive.

32
00:02:57,620 --> 00:02:59,060
I heard Boss Ren

33
00:02:59,580 --> 00:03:01,020
has put you in charge
of the loan shark case.

34
00:03:01,220 --> 00:03:03,780
Oh, you're too kind.

35
00:03:03,780 --> 00:03:04,820
I'm afraid I haven't done my job well.

36
00:03:04,820 --> 00:03:06,740
I failed to prevent the tragedy
in the Kuang family.

37
00:03:07,020 --> 00:03:10,380
I hope you'll forgive me, Miss Kuang.

38
00:03:10,420 --> 00:03:13,180
Oh, that was a matter of karma.

39
00:03:13,220 --> 00:03:14,340
How could I blame you?

40
00:03:14,500 --> 00:03:15,740
If you ever need anything,

41
00:03:16,060 --> 00:03:17,060
just say the word.

42
00:03:17,060 --> 00:03:18,220
Actually, there's something
I need right now.

43
00:03:18,220 --> 00:03:19,540
Oh? Go ahead.

44
00:03:20,020 --> 00:03:21,020
I want to see Ding Zhao.

45
00:03:22,220 --> 00:03:23,740
I still have a personal
score to settle with him.

46
00:03:29,860 --> 00:03:31,180
I'm afraid you're too late.

47
00:03:31,460 --> 00:03:32,780
He's dead.

48
00:03:33,420 --> 00:03:34,220
Dead?

49
00:03:35,460 --> 00:03:36,740
Wasn't he transferred
to the detention center?

50
00:03:36,740 --> 00:03:37,260
Why...

51
00:03:37,260 --> 00:03:38,420
He attacked a police officer
during the transfer

52
00:03:38,420 --> 00:03:39,940
and was executed on the spot.

53
00:03:43,300 --> 00:03:44,180
Miss Kuang.

54
00:03:44,420 --> 00:03:46,100
You're a smart woman.

55
00:03:47,260 --> 00:03:49,300
You should stop getting
involved in their schemes.

56
00:03:49,500 --> 00:03:51,820
And don't challenge
Kun Society's limits again.

57
00:03:52,660 --> 00:03:53,780
Consider this

58
00:03:54,700 --> 00:03:56,060
my final warning

59
00:03:57,420 --> 00:03:58,660
to you and your friends.

60
00:04:01,020 --> 00:04:01,820
Goodbye.

61
00:04:09,780 --> 00:04:10,540
Dead?

62
00:04:20,020 --> 00:04:20,820
What did he say?

63
00:04:23,820 --> 00:04:24,780
He said

64
00:04:26,140 --> 00:04:27,180
Ding Zhao is dead.

65
00:04:28,500 --> 00:04:29,300
Impossible.

66
00:04:29,420 --> 00:04:30,740
He attacked a police officer
during the transfer

67
00:04:31,380 --> 00:04:32,820
and was shot dead on the spot.

68
00:04:32,820 --> 00:04:33,820
That's absolutely impossible.

69
00:04:34,460 --> 00:04:37,180
He wouldn't die like that.

70
00:04:39,500 --> 00:04:40,300
Madam.

71
00:04:40,660 --> 00:04:41,460
Didn't you say

72
00:04:41,460 --> 00:04:43,260
there were no transfers scheduled
at the detention center today?

73
00:04:44,020 --> 00:04:45,780
Then there's no way he attacked
an officer during a transfer

74
00:04:45,780 --> 00:04:46,740
and was shot dead on the spot.

75
00:04:47,420 --> 00:04:48,180
Of course I know.

76
00:04:48,460 --> 00:04:50,340
That's just Kun Society's
excuse for killing him.

77
00:04:50,420 --> 00:04:52,220
But Long Feng clearly promised...

78
00:04:52,260 --> 00:04:53,860
How could you trust Long Feng?

79
00:04:54,120 --> 00:04:54,760
Something's not right.

80
00:04:55,860 --> 00:04:57,580
If they wanted Ding Zhao dead,

81
00:04:58,220 --> 00:04:59,940
they could have killed him
when they first took him away.

82
00:05:00,540 --> 00:05:02,420
Why wait until today

83
00:05:02,900 --> 00:05:05,620
and invent some story about a transfer?

84
00:05:06,420 --> 00:05:07,700
Who wanted him transferred?

85
00:05:07,700 --> 00:05:08,820
And who wanted him dead?

86
00:05:09,020 --> 00:05:09,860
When I was at Kaimeili,

87
00:05:09,900 --> 00:05:11,660
I saw many young girls.

88
00:05:12,380 --> 00:05:14,900
I also heard Jiang Menhu and Long Feng

89
00:05:14,900 --> 00:05:17,100
talking about preparations
for a cruise party

90
00:05:17,220 --> 00:05:19,180
to satisfy the bosses' desires.

91
00:05:22,200 --> 00:05:23,880
(Huangpu River Cruise Dinner)

92
00:05:25,380 --> 00:05:26,340
I understand now.

93
00:05:27,980 --> 00:05:29,820
They kept Ding Zhao alive until today

94
00:05:30,380 --> 00:05:31,420
and drugged you

95
00:05:32,100 --> 00:05:33,700
to distract us

96
00:05:33,820 --> 00:05:34,940
and keep us off the cruise ship

97
00:05:34,940 --> 00:05:36,100
so we couldn't disrupt
their dinner party.

98
00:05:37,020 --> 00:05:39,180
They must be taking those girls aboard

99
00:05:39,500 --> 00:05:40,580
to do the same thing all over again.

100
00:05:42,820 --> 00:05:45,180
I still don't believe
Ding Zhao would die like that.

101
00:05:46,580 --> 00:05:47,380
Dr. Bai.

102
00:05:47,620 --> 00:05:49,860
Could you please wait
for him at his home?

103
00:05:50,580 --> 00:05:51,580
If he's injured,

104
00:05:51,580 --> 00:05:52,420
he'll definitely go back there.

105
00:05:53,460 --> 00:05:54,260
If...

106
00:05:55,020 --> 00:05:56,220
I mean, if

107
00:05:57,100 --> 00:05:58,220
he really is dead,

108
00:05:59,820 --> 00:06:00,620
Madam,

109
00:06:01,060 --> 00:06:02,780
could you please stay here

110
00:06:02,820 --> 00:06:03,780
and make the arrangements

111
00:06:03,780 --> 00:06:04,740
to bring him home?

112
00:06:04,820 --> 00:06:05,620
What about you?

113
00:06:07,860 --> 00:06:08,770
I'm going aboard the cruise ship.

114
00:06:08,770 --> 00:06:09,620
Have you lost your mind?

115
00:06:09,700 --> 00:06:10,420
It's a Kun Society gathering.

116
00:06:10,420 --> 00:06:11,700
You can't just walk in.

117
00:06:11,700 --> 00:06:12,380
I can get in.

118
00:06:12,380 --> 00:06:13,300
I have a way.

119
00:06:13,300 --> 00:06:14,540
You just have to trust me

120
00:06:14,860 --> 00:06:16,020
and do as I say.

121
00:06:16,060 --> 00:06:16,860
The last person who said that

122
00:06:16,860 --> 00:06:18,060
almost got killed.

123
00:06:18,780 --> 00:06:20,220
If Ding Zhao is still alive,

124
00:06:20,220 --> 00:06:21,220
how will we find you?

125
00:06:21,220 --> 00:06:22,220
Don't come looking for me.

126
00:06:22,620 --> 00:06:23,820
Get Ding Zhao out of Shanghai.

127
00:06:23,820 --> 00:06:24,780
The sooner, the better.

128
00:06:24,980 --> 00:06:25,780
Oh, and one more thing.

129
00:06:26,220 --> 00:06:27,220
At seven tonight,

130
00:06:27,460 --> 00:06:28,780
whether you've found me or not,

131
00:06:29,020 --> 00:06:30,820
contact the reporters you know.

132
00:06:30,820 --> 00:06:32,100
Tell them to wait on the shore

133
00:06:32,100 --> 00:06:34,540
because there's a big story coming.

134
00:06:35,020 --> 00:06:36,180
What big story?

135
00:06:36,220 --> 00:06:37,460
You'll find out when the time comes.

136
00:06:39,220 --> 00:06:40,020
Miss Mei.

137
00:06:44,900 --> 00:06:46,260
Madam, aren't you going to stop her?

138
00:06:46,260 --> 00:06:47,060
Why would I stop

139
00:06:47,060 --> 00:06:48,460
someone who's trying
to avenge her loved ones?

140
00:06:48,460 --> 00:06:50,060
Going aboard that cruise ship
is far too dangerous.

141
00:06:50,220 --> 00:06:51,740
We all make our own choices.

142
00:06:53,580 --> 00:06:54,380
All we can do

143
00:06:54,380 --> 00:06:55,700
is what we believe is right.

144
00:07:00,220 --> 00:07:01,020
One more thing.

145
00:07:01,500 --> 00:07:02,860
If you see Ding Zhao,

146
00:07:04,380 --> 00:07:05,860
there's something
I need you to tell him.

147
00:07:45,180 --> 00:07:45,980
Uncle.

148
00:07:51,020 --> 00:07:51,820
Uncle.

149
00:07:58,300 --> 00:07:59,740
Uncle!

150
00:08:01,180 --> 00:08:02,140
Uncle!

151
00:08:02,820 --> 00:08:04,460
Thank goodness you're alive.

152
00:08:06,020 --> 00:08:07,140
You're hurt?

153
00:08:08,580 --> 00:08:09,940
Sit down. Let me take a look.

154
00:08:11,260 --> 00:08:14,020
There's alcohol and gauze
in the back room.

155
00:08:14,420 --> 00:08:15,220
Could you get them for me?

156
00:08:15,220 --> 00:08:16,020
I'll be right back.

157
00:08:30,900 --> 00:08:31,820
Wait. Slow down.

158
00:08:46,500 --> 00:08:47,860
How did you escape?

159
00:08:49,530 --> 00:08:51,780
Someone deliberately let me go.

160
00:08:52,310 --> 00:08:53,540
Who wants me dead?

161
00:08:54,580 --> 00:08:55,980
Boss Ren or Long Feng?

162
00:08:56,380 --> 00:08:57,460
You're about to die anyway.

163
00:08:57,460 --> 00:08:58,020
What's the point

164
00:08:58,020 --> 00:08:59,260
of asking so many questions?

165
00:08:59,930 --> 00:09:00,850
It matters.

166
00:09:09,990 --> 00:09:12,140
You only get one chance
to save your life.

167
00:09:12,580 --> 00:09:14,290
Take the money and get out of Shanghai.

168
00:09:14,660 --> 00:09:16,020
Who told you to save me?

169
00:09:16,420 --> 00:09:17,220
It doesn't matter.

170
00:09:27,220 --> 00:09:28,380
She didn't lie to me.

171
00:09:28,820 --> 00:09:29,780
What did you say?

172
00:09:30,100 --> 00:09:32,100
Nothing.

173
00:09:32,100 --> 00:09:33,060
This might hurt a little.

174
00:09:33,260 --> 00:09:34,460
I'll clean the wound first.

175
00:09:34,620 --> 00:09:35,700
Where's my uncle?

176
00:09:36,180 --> 00:09:37,540
Have you seen my uncle?

177
00:09:39,180 --> 00:09:39,940
Ding Zhao's uncle

178
00:09:39,940 --> 00:09:41,860
was devastated after learning

179
00:09:44,180 --> 00:09:45,140
what happened to him and Ding Yiyi.

180
00:09:46,050 --> 00:09:46,780
He passed away.

181
00:09:54,300 --> 00:09:55,260
In the end,

182
00:09:58,020 --> 00:09:59,740
I couldn't protect anyone.

183
00:10:01,660 --> 00:10:02,620
Yiyi.

184
00:10:04,100 --> 00:10:04,980
Uncle.

185
00:10:08,700 --> 00:10:09,740
I'm sorry for your loss.

186
00:10:10,180 --> 00:10:12,060
He and Yiyi are both
at the abandoned temple.

187
00:10:12,820 --> 00:10:13,860
Once you're feeling better,

188
00:10:14,620 --> 00:10:15,860
I'll go with you to see them off.

189
00:10:27,660 --> 00:10:28,820
Where's Mei Yuhe?

190
00:10:32,620 --> 00:10:33,940
You don't need to worry about
the funeral arrangements.

191
00:10:34,260 --> 00:10:36,420
Mrs. Kuang and I will help you.

192
00:10:37,220 --> 00:10:38,020
Oh, and

193
00:10:38,220 --> 00:10:40,020
Yan Qing is also
at the abandoned temple.

194
00:10:40,220 --> 00:10:42,740
We can hold a funeral
for all of them together.

195
00:10:42,820 --> 00:10:44,620
As you Chinese would say,

196
00:10:44,740 --> 00:10:46,180
that way, they won't be
lonely on their journey.

197
00:10:46,460 --> 00:10:47,940
I'm asking you where Mei Yuhe is.

198
00:10:53,500 --> 00:10:54,300
Bai Mali.

199
00:10:55,020 --> 00:10:55,940
Tell me.

200
00:10:56,620 --> 00:10:58,620
Has something happened to Mei Yuhe?

201
00:11:01,020 --> 00:11:02,220
She wants you to leave Shanghai

202
00:11:02,420 --> 00:11:03,460
and never come back.

203
00:11:03,620 --> 00:11:04,660
Where is she?

204
00:11:04,660 --> 00:11:05,620
Tell me.

205
00:11:09,460 --> 00:11:10,260
Say something!

206
00:11:11,020 --> 00:11:11,980
Where's Mei Yuhe?

207
00:11:12,700 --> 00:11:13,660
She's going aboard a cruise ship.

208
00:11:13,660 --> 00:11:14,540
What cruise ship?

209
00:11:15,620 --> 00:11:17,460
The cruise party hosted by Kun Society.

210
00:11:18,460 --> 00:11:19,260
Take me there.

211
00:11:20,180 --> 00:11:21,700
How can you go in your condition?

212
00:11:34,780 --> 00:11:35,820
Look at this bubble!

213
00:11:36,060 --> 00:11:36,740
My turn! My turn!

214
00:11:36,740 --> 00:11:37,420
Let me show you a move.

215
00:11:37,420 --> 00:11:38,940
Three, two, one, go!

216
00:11:43,660 --> 00:11:44,580
It's so pretty.

217
00:11:44,580 --> 00:11:45,220
Let me try.

218
00:11:48,620 --> 00:11:49,380
Yuhe.

219
00:11:49,380 --> 00:11:50,940
Where have you been these past few days?

220
00:11:51,020 --> 00:11:52,100
I've gone looking for you several times,

221
00:11:52,100 --> 00:11:53,300
but you were never there.

222
00:11:54,020 --> 00:11:56,580
Jiusheng told me you had
an argument with Mr. Jing?

223
00:12:00,020 --> 00:12:00,860
Why?

224
00:12:01,020 --> 00:12:02,380
Don't you like him anymore?

225
00:12:04,420 --> 00:12:05,940
Is Mr. Jing inside?

226
00:12:06,180 --> 00:12:07,580
Yes. I'll take you to him.

227
00:12:12,020 --> 00:12:12,660
Slow down.

228
00:12:16,740 --> 00:12:17,260
Sir.

229
00:12:17,260 --> 00:12:18,780
What color tie would you
like to wear today?

230
00:12:22,580 --> 00:12:23,620
Let me help you choose.

231
00:12:28,420 --> 00:12:29,940
Jiusheng, leave us for now.

232
00:12:40,020 --> 00:12:41,260
What are you doing here?

233
00:12:42,900 --> 00:12:43,980
I want to go aboard the cruise ship.

234
00:12:44,120 --> 00:12:46,620
Cruise ship? What for?

235
00:12:46,660 --> 00:12:49,980
To become a cat, of course.

236
00:12:51,380 --> 00:12:52,180
You...

237
00:12:52,380 --> 00:12:54,180
Didn't you tell Boss Ren yourself

238
00:12:54,500 --> 00:12:56,180
that the Japanese were interested in me?

239
00:12:56,300 --> 00:12:58,180
Wouldn't offering me to him now

240
00:12:58,220 --> 00:13:00,100
be an even better way
to prove your loyalty?

241
00:13:00,220 --> 00:13:01,420
That was just an excuse.

242
00:13:01,900 --> 00:13:03,420
How could I possibly hand
you over to the Japanese?

243
00:13:03,460 --> 00:13:04,540
Why wouldn't you?

244
00:13:06,620 --> 00:13:08,900
Weren't you close to Lv Mengde?

245
00:13:10,620 --> 00:13:11,780
You should know all about

246
00:13:13,490 --> 00:13:15,020
how he operated.

247
00:13:15,900 --> 00:13:17,020
Look at this photo.

248
00:13:17,100 --> 00:13:20,020
You and Lv Mengde seem
to be getting along very well.

249
00:13:25,500 --> 00:13:27,140
Lv Mengde did approach me
about business.

250
00:13:27,420 --> 00:13:29,100
He wanted a list
of the girls I was supporting,

251
00:13:29,620 --> 00:13:31,940
along with the children taken
in by my Cishan Foundation.

252
00:13:32,820 --> 00:13:34,020
But I refused.

253
00:13:34,140 --> 00:13:35,060
So that means

254
00:13:36,020 --> 00:13:38,020
you knew what he was doing all along.

255
00:13:39,420 --> 00:13:40,220
I did.

256
00:13:40,220 --> 00:13:41,620
Then why did you trick me
into investigating?

257
00:13:41,980 --> 00:13:43,020
I didn't deceive you.

258
00:13:43,660 --> 00:13:45,380
I wanted us to fight
for justice together.

259
00:13:46,220 --> 00:13:47,020
I knew

260
00:13:47,260 --> 00:13:48,020
they were involved

261
00:13:48,020 --> 00:13:49,340
in what happened to Xiaozhu.

262
00:13:49,580 --> 00:13:51,260
But I had no concrete evidence.

263
00:13:51,380 --> 00:13:52,940
I couldn't openly accuse them.

264
00:13:53,420 --> 00:13:56,180
Not until I met you.

265
00:13:56,580 --> 00:13:58,180
I watched you investigate tirelessly

266
00:13:58,220 --> 00:13:59,260
and attempt to assassinate Lv Mengde.

267
00:13:59,500 --> 00:14:00,740
Then I suddenly began to wonder

268
00:14:01,100 --> 00:14:02,380
whether we could work together

269
00:14:02,660 --> 00:14:03,620
and use public opinion

270
00:14:04,020 --> 00:14:06,060
to expose the evidence
of their crimes to everyone.

271
00:14:06,300 --> 00:14:07,420
Since that's the case,

272
00:14:08,580 --> 00:14:09,780
take me aboard the cruise ship.

273
00:14:12,380 --> 00:14:13,540
I'm going there to kill someone.

274
00:14:14,220 --> 00:14:15,340
It'll only make things
harder if I bring you.

275
00:14:15,620 --> 00:14:16,500
Who are you going to kill?

276
00:14:27,900 --> 00:14:28,940
You're right.

277
00:14:30,060 --> 00:14:31,980
You really are on
Kun Society's guest list.

278
00:14:32,380 --> 00:14:34,980
And they really do plan
to offer you to the Japanese.

279
00:14:35,020 --> 00:14:36,340
But I didn't tell you,

280
00:14:36,820 --> 00:14:38,100
and I didn't give you an invitation.

281
00:14:39,060 --> 00:14:40,180
Can you guess why?

282
00:14:40,620 --> 00:14:41,860
You're going to kill the Japanese man.

283
00:14:42,100 --> 00:14:43,100
As long as the Japanese man

284
00:14:43,420 --> 00:14:45,100
dies on this cruise ship tonight,

285
00:14:46,380 --> 00:14:47,580
the bosses of Kun Society

286
00:14:47,620 --> 00:14:49,220
won't be able to stay out of it anymore.

287
00:14:49,620 --> 00:14:50,740
As long as he dies,

288
00:14:51,220 --> 00:14:53,340
there will be no ball tonight,

289
00:14:53,620 --> 00:14:55,820
and those girls won't
come to harm either.

290
00:14:56,580 --> 00:14:57,420
Miss Mei.

291
00:14:57,900 --> 00:14:59,660
You can blame me or hate me.

292
00:14:59,660 --> 00:15:00,700
It doesn't matter.

293
00:15:01,380 --> 00:15:02,460
Once tonight is over,

294
00:15:03,020 --> 00:15:04,340
I'll make things right with you.

295
00:15:04,660 --> 00:15:06,260
I don't need you to make things right.

296
00:15:06,780 --> 00:15:08,340
Since our goals are the same,

297
00:15:08,780 --> 00:15:10,540
we can keep working together.

298
00:15:10,820 --> 00:15:12,420
This is an enormous risk.

299
00:15:15,020 --> 00:15:17,500
I'm willing to risk it on my instincts.

300
00:15:36,500 --> 00:15:37,300
Mrs. Kuang.

301
00:15:38,180 --> 00:15:38,980
Mr. Ding.

302
00:15:41,700 --> 00:15:42,940
Have you seen Mei Yuhe?

303
00:15:43,380 --> 00:15:44,300
Miss Mei, she...

304
00:15:46,220 --> 00:15:47,460
She's already gone aboard?

305
00:15:47,460 --> 00:15:48,220
Yes.

306
00:15:51,020 --> 00:15:52,140
It only left a short while ago.

307
00:15:52,220 --> 00:15:53,020
There's still time.

308
00:15:53,620 --> 00:15:55,620
Madam, he's still injured.

309
00:16:02,620 --> 00:16:04,540
Take this gentleman
and catch up with the cruise ship.

310
00:16:04,660 --> 00:16:05,580
As long as you catch up to it

311
00:16:05,580 --> 00:16:06,900
and bring him back safely,

312
00:16:06,900 --> 00:16:08,420
I'll give you another reward.

313
00:16:08,420 --> 00:16:09,180
Don't worry.

314
00:16:11,260 --> 00:16:12,060
I'm going too.

315
00:16:12,180 --> 00:16:13,060
What are you going for?

316
00:16:13,060 --> 00:16:13,780
I'm a doctor

317
00:16:13,780 --> 00:16:14,620
and a foreigner.

318
00:16:14,620 --> 00:16:15,540
If anything happens,

319
00:16:15,620 --> 00:16:16,860
I may still be of some help.

320
00:16:18,020 --> 00:16:18,820
Thank you.

321
00:16:18,820 --> 00:16:19,420
Hurry up.

322
00:16:19,420 --> 00:16:20,500
If you don't leave now,
it'll be too late.

323
00:16:23,020 --> 00:16:25,140
You must bring Miss Mei back safely.

324
00:16:25,580 --> 00:16:26,940
I'll stay on shore and support you.

325
00:16:36,300 --> 00:16:39,380
♪Whose glass of red wine?♪

326
00:16:40,020 --> 00:16:42,980
♪Whose high heels?♪

327
00:16:43,980 --> 00:16:50,420
♪Whose slender waist is swaying?♪

328
00:17:00,580 --> 00:17:02,270
- Good!
- Good!

329
00:17:16,020 --> 00:17:18,020
First of all, thank you all for coming

330
00:17:18,020 --> 00:17:20,060
to the cruise banquet we're hosting.

331
00:17:20,420 --> 00:17:21,220
Now,

332
00:17:21,220 --> 00:17:22,220
let's invite Jiang Menhu,

333
00:17:22,380 --> 00:17:25,460
our famous Chinese detective inspector,
to say a few words.

334
00:17:25,980 --> 00:17:26,780
Good!

335
00:17:33,260 --> 00:17:34,100
This banquet

336
00:17:34,100 --> 00:17:36,300
was organized in just a few short days.

337
00:17:36,300 --> 00:17:37,260
First of all, we must thank

338
00:17:37,260 --> 00:17:40,700
the bosses here today
for their money and effort.

339
00:17:41,300 --> 00:17:42,100
Of course,

340
00:17:42,380 --> 00:17:43,980
none of this would have been
possible without

341
00:17:43,980 --> 00:17:46,100
Boss Ren's tremendous support.

342
00:17:46,820 --> 00:17:48,360
Next, let us all

343
00:17:48,360 --> 00:17:50,540
raise a glass to Boss Ren.

344
00:17:56,820 --> 00:17:57,620
Come on.

345
00:17:57,620 --> 00:17:58,340
Cheers.

346
00:18:15,180 --> 00:18:16,020
This banquet

347
00:18:16,300 --> 00:18:17,780
is meant to show everyone

348
00:18:18,180 --> 00:18:19,980
that Kun Society is still
the same Kun Society.

349
00:18:20,020 --> 00:18:22,180
It won't be affected

350
00:18:22,220 --> 00:18:23,740
by a little commotion like this.

351
00:18:24,300 --> 00:18:27,020
Kun Society's doors will
always remain open to all,

352
00:18:27,300 --> 00:18:29,180
and we welcome cooperation
from every walk of life.

353
00:18:38,620 --> 00:18:39,420
Next,

354
00:18:39,700 --> 00:18:42,220
we've prepared a fireworks show

355
00:18:42,620 --> 00:18:43,900
for your enjoyment.

356
00:18:49,980 --> 00:18:50,780
Come on.

357
00:18:50,900 --> 00:18:51,980
I'll take you to meet someone.

358
00:19:12,080 --> 00:19:14,840
♪And watch the lights
come on one by one♪

359
00:19:15,480 --> 00:19:18,480
♪Like blades cutting
through the radiance♪

360
00:19:19,120 --> 00:19:21,880
♪You may treat me as dust
beneath your feet♪

361
00:19:21,880 --> 00:19:23,840
♪Or wipe me away like ashes♪

362
00:19:23,840 --> 00:19:25,400
♪Leaving a cold ending♪

363
00:19:25,400 --> 00:19:27,360
♪But I refuse to fall♪

364
00:19:27,360 --> 00:19:32,400
♪I refuse to become a shadow
fading beneath the lights♪

365
00:19:32,400 --> 00:19:34,880
♪I refuse to dissolve into♪

366
00:19:35,920 --> 00:19:38,880
♪The lifeless light of the past♪

367
00:19:39,280 --> 00:19:42,160
♪I want sharpness at my fingertips♪

368
00:19:42,160 --> 00:19:45,080
♪And steps that avoid
the traps among the thorns♪

369
00:19:45,640 --> 00:19:48,520
♪At dawn, I will look
straight into your eyes♪

370
00:19:48,520 --> 00:19:51,920
♪My gaze clear, illuminating the dawn♪

371
00:19:53,200 --> 00:19:55,840
♪Those who have hurt me♪

372
00:19:56,480 --> 00:19:59,160
♪I choose to pierce through♪

373
00:20:00,840 --> 00:20:02,320
♪To tear apart♪

374
00:20:02,440 --> 00:20:08,400
♪To ignite a sacred flame♪

375
00:20:09,960 --> 00:20:11,960
♪I do not pray to the gods♪

376
00:20:11,960 --> 00:20:14,960
♪Nor bow to power♪

377
00:20:14,960 --> 00:20:17,400
♪I will no longer play the tragic lead♪

378
00:20:19,160 --> 00:20:22,840
♪I will stand and carve
the path of my own fate♪
